  "description": "Nubrik is a visual page builder for Umbraco, built for agencies and in-house teams who need full brand control without compromise.\n\n\t\t\tBuild pages visually using ready-made blocks, brand-controlled themes, and a live preview experience — all while writing content back natively to Umbraco.\n\n\t\t\tKey features:\n\t\t\t- Brand-first editing with custom colors, fonts, and assets baked in\n\t\t\t- Ready-made building blocks to launch pages and campaign sites quickly\n\t\t\t- Live preview while building — see exactly what your audience will see\n\t\t\t- Save and reuse page layouts across briefs and projects\n\n\t\t\tRequirements: Umbraco 17+, .NET 10\n\n\t\t\tA valid license key is required for production use.\n\n\t\t\tFor installation instructions, licensing, and support:\n\t\t\thttps://support.nubrik.app/hc/nubrik/articles/1780907445-installing-nubrik",
